      "text_md": "Article 1\n\nThe template document to be used by competent authorities of Member States, where possible for cooperation arrangements pursuant to Article 107(1) of Regulation (EU) 2023/1114 is set out in the Annex to this Regulation.",
      "text_sha256": "cc76bf2b4b1b94697dc88f798e3fa664fd8354042ea2f10464e9860514aea8ae",
      "md_span": {
